  "reading": "If the interval expert's AUROC holds after the common 500 Hz step, the sampling rate itself was not what it used. The control inputs reached the network at 500 Hz already in wp4c, so a control above chance points to another difference of the four natively 500 Hz recordings (all arrhythmia): their recording setting, which resampling cannot remove. Only recordings of both classes from one setting can separate rhythm from setting."
